<rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>some.pics (中文)</title><link>https://some.pics</link><description>只是网上的一些图片。</description><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Tue, 15 Sep 2026 23:36:43 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>您似乎只发送了一个表情符号😳，并没有包含需要翻译的英文内容。请提供您需要翻译的英文文本（包含HTML标签也可以），我会为您翻译成流畅自然的中文。</title><link>https://some.pics/6aa9d68746ce6</link><description>&lt;p&gt;您似乎只发送了一个表情符号😳，并没有包含需要翻译的英文内容。请提供您需要翻译的英文文本（包含HTML标签也可以），我会为您翻译成流畅自然的中文。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A small black and white dog lies on her back, leaning against a man’s leg, with wide eyes as if she’s alarmed by something." height="2448" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/jinx/6aa9d68746ce6.jpg" width="3264"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://jinx.some.pics"&gt;@jinx&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 15 Sep 2026 23:36:43 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>等候室</title><link>https://some.pics/6aa98120df570</link><description>&lt;p&gt;等候室&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Apart from two people, the waiting room is completely empty, with a wall of windows looking out onto the water and a raised ramp. In front of the windows and along one wall stands a row of chairs; otherwise, round tables with orange chairs are scattered throughout the huge hall.
" height="3564" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/roteskuffen/6aa98120df570.jpg" width="3000"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://roteskuffen.some.pics"&gt;@roteskuffen&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 15 Sep 2026 17:32:20 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>（几乎）单色星期二</title><link>https://some.pics/6aa98052433a9</link><description>&lt;p&gt;（几乎）单色星期二&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A still lake, greyed by the low-hanging clouds. On the other side, it is raining amongst the rolling hills. In the foreground, tall grass and shrubs are a pale yellow and brown. A branch from a conifer hangs down into the picture from above. The picture has a rather monochrome feel to it" height="3968" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/roteskuffen/6aa98052433a9.jpg" width="2976"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://roteskuffen.some.pics"&gt;@roteskuffen&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 15 Sep 2026 17:28:54 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>小蜜蛾</title><link>https://some.pics/6aa96738ee68a</link><description>&lt;p&gt;小蜂蜜蛾子之类的东西&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A photo of a pink flower with a chunky little brown and orange moth with a long tube drinking from flowers like a hummingbird." height="2306" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/tristy/6aa96738ee68a.jpg" width="2306"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://tristy.some.pics"&gt;@tristy&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 15 Sep 2026 15:41:48 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>意大利美食</title><link>https://some.pics/6aa9565458c1b</link><description>&lt;p&gt;意大利美食&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt='Storefront of DELITALY Italian food shop with brown awning displaying "PRODOTTI ITALIANI SALUMERIA" and shelves of jarred pickled vegetables and preserved foods behind glass windows.' height="2345" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/mihobu/6aa9565458c1b.jpg" width="2231"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://mihobu.some.pics"&gt;@mihobu&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 15 Sep 2026 14:29:44 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>巴黎圣日耳曼德佩教堂内部</title><link>https://some.pics/6aa93d69dcb82</link><description>&lt;p&gt;巴黎圣日耳曼德佩教堂内部&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Interior of a Gothic cathedral with ornate arches, decorative columns, and colorful tilework. A chandelier hangs from chains. Painted religious figures adorn the walls." height="2334" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/mihobu/6aa93d69dcb82.jpg" width="2362"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://mihobu.some.pics"&gt;@mihobu&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 15 Sep 2026 12:43:25 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>在巴黎的圣叙尔皮斯教堂（Église Saint Sulpice）内</title><link>https://some.pics/6aa93ca40c0e1</link><description>&lt;p&gt;在巴黎的圣叙尔皮斯教堂（Église Saint Sulpice）内&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Interior of a grand cathedral with wooden chairs arranged in rows facing an ornate altar. Tall dark columns, a large clock, gilt chandelier, and classical architectural details visible throughout the solemn space." height="2524" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/mihobu/6aa93ca40c0e1.jpg" width="2524"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://mihobu.some.pics"&gt;@mihobu&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 15 Sep 2026 12:40:09 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>水果与豆类</title><link>https://some.pics/6aa93a7a3f8a1</link><description>&lt;p&gt;水果与豆类&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt='A fruit and vegetable shop storefront in Paris with an orange awning reads "Fruits &amp;amp; Legumes" and "Le Verger des 4 Saisons." Produce displays line the entrance with apples, berries, and other items. Ivy grows up the left wall.' height="2176" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/mihobu/6aa93a7a3f8a1.jpg" width="2176"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://mihobu.some.pics"&gt;@mihobu&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 15 Sep 2026 12:30:54 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>有趣的小家伙</title><link>https://some.pics/6aa93059f2370</link><description>&lt;p&gt;有趣的小家伙&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A small bee takes off from within a pink autumn crocus. " height="3024" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/tristy/6aa93059f2370.jpg" width="4032"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://tristy.some.pics"&gt;@tristy&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 15 Sep 2026 11:47:42 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>在巴黎的圣叙尔皮斯教堂（Église Saint Sulpice）内</title><link>https://some.pics/6aa9272373c86</link><description>&lt;p&gt;在巴黎的圣叙尔皮斯教堂（Église Saint Sulpice）内&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Interior of a grand chapel with ornate gold-trimmed domed ceiling, large fresco above altar, Corinthian columns, and religious paintings on side walls. A person kneels at the altar railing." height="2688" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/mihobu/6aa9272373c86.jpg" width="4032"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://mihobu.some.pics"&gt;@mihobu&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 15 Sep 2026 11:08:24 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>